    "body": "Does [form-associated element](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#form-associated-element) (or one of the named subsets thereof) not cover this?\r\n> A number of the elements are **form-associated elements**, which means they can have a [form owner](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#form-owner).\r\n> \r\n> ⇒ `button`, `fieldset`, `input`, `object`, `output`, `select`, `textarea`, `img`",
