    "body": "Given text in [css-display](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/blob/a0b4213aff7a187cf60804063743059bfa10dc0c/css-display/Overview.bs#L485) and the even older [css-ui](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/blob/e44395c1da8aef59cf71cce9c3c52bf2769f91ce/css-ui-4/Overview.bs#L1088), [submittable elements](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#category-submit) seems like the closest match, but this is probably a distinct category.",
